sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Saga orchestrator
  participant O as Order svc
  participant P as Payment svc
  participant I as Inventory svc
  S->>O: createOrder (PENDING)
  O-->>S: ok
  S->>P: chargePayment
  P-->>S: ok
  S->>I: reserveStock
  I--xS: failed (out of stock)
  Note over S: Start compensation (reverse order)
  S->>P: refundPayment
  P-->>S: refunded
  S->>O: cancelOrder
  O-->>S: cancelled
  Note over S: Saga state = COMPENSATED
